If a clinical-practice-organization has a naloxone-training-resource then the clinical-practice-organization may facilitate a naloxone-coprescribing.
Every pharmacist-collaborative-practice-model may facilitate a naloxone-coprescribing.
Every statewide-naloxone-protocol may facilitate a naloxone-coprescribing.
Every pharmacy-naloxone-standing-order may facilitate a naloxone-coprescribing.
